#. Description of the plugin
#: paypercut-payments-for-woocommerce.php
msgid "Paypercut Payments enables WooCommerce merchants to accept online payments using Paypercut's checkout experience."
msgstr "Paypercut Payments permite a los vendedores de WooCommerce aceptar pagos en línea mediante la experiencia de pago de Paypercut."
